{"id":"659922","name":"肉夹馍","author":"丽彩（五谷杂粮）","authorId":"12357987","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/659922/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"500克"},{"name":"猪肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"卤料包","amount":"一包"},{"name":"青椒","amount":"一个"}],"sub":[{"name":"水","amount":"260克"},{"name":"食用油","amount":"少量"},{"name":"冰糖","amount":"一小把"},{"name":"耗油","amount":"一勺"},{"name":"老抽","amount":"一勺"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"一勺"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"两勺"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"锅里倒入适量的食用油把冰糖炒出糖色，放入焯水后的猪肉编程上色(买了肥肉练猪油，皮顺便也卤了)。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/12/20240712172074713802084012357987.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入耗油，老抽，生抽继续翻炒。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/12/20240712172074713944881112357987.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":3,"desc":"再加入和肉差不多的水，放入卤肉包煮开。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/12/20240712172074714017791612357987.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":4,"desc":"水煮开后改小火焖煮半个小时。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/12/20240712172074714085311612357987.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":5,"desc":"根据情况加入适量的盐，翻拌均匀后捞出猪皮，盖上锅盖让肉继续焖煮半小时。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/12/20240712172074714137457312357987.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":6,"desc":"把肉放在汤汁里浸泡着。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/12/20240712172074714211948112357987.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":7,"desc":"面粉500克，酵母5克，白糖10克。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/12/20240712172074714319824412357987.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":8,"desc":"搅拌均匀，用260克水和面。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/12/20240712172074714394597412357987.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":9,"desc":"揉成面团。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/12/20240712172074714457882012357987.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":10,"desc":"分成小剂子，搓条。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/12/20240712172074714515886812357987.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":11,"desc":"擀牛舌状，从一头卷起。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/12/20240712172074714570277312357987.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":12,"desc":"收口朝下。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/12/20240712172074714636655112357987.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":13,"desc":"按扁。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/12/20240712172074714696024112357987.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":14,"desc":"用擀面杖擀薄，等待发酵完成。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/12/20240712172074714759622412357987.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":15,"desc":"发酵完成后放入电饼铛中火烙至表面金黄。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/12/20240712172074714821435112357987.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":16,"desc":"卤好的肉加入青椒剁碎。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/12/20240712172074714918494612357987.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":17,"desc":"夹入烙好的饼中。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/12/20240712172074715036627912357987.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饼铛、不粘锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}